<p>Creates a globe of pure light within a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> that illuminates the area and deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">127, 171, 205, 234, 260</acronym> damage to all creatures.</p><p>At level 3, it also blinds all who see it (except the caster) for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.</p>